WEBVTT

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:10.390
Good morning, Saeki-san!

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:11.820
Oh, good morning.

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:17.680
Kurata-san...

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:19.480
What is it?

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:22.680
Um, well...

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:26.580
Is that the cycling event you mentioned before?

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:31.180
Yes, I finally participated in the Autumn Ride.

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.590
The one you spoke of last time.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:39.850
I finished 160 kilometers!

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:42.480
160?! That many?

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:46.480
I barely made it, but I managed somehow!

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:49.020
I was so happy...

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.440
finishing with my team.

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:54.720
Say...

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:41.810
Hey, Ami...

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:43.010
What is it?

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:46.890
What do you want to do about the practice ride?
We can join up this weekend.

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:49.020
What? Just like that?

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:51.020
What? What's going on?

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:56.780
You know how it was rough for Ami
towards the end of the Autumn Ride?

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:01.240
You did your best,
but it was too close for comfort.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:04.280
Yes...

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:08.280
And you said you wanted to get faster,

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:11.540
so I thought it would be best
for her to go on practice rides.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:18.760
But this practice ride is even tougher
than the 160 kilometer Autumn Ride, right?

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:23.550
Isn't it too soon for me to do it...?

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.960
Don't be such a wimp!

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:27.270
Show some grit! Grit!

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:32.690
Saki, you tell her too.
That she should do the practice ride.

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:37.940
Even if you can't keep up in the beginning,
just participating consistently will make you stronger.

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.240
Right?

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:43.320
Besides, you're interested in participating in a flèche and a brevet, right?

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.820
Yes, I am.

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:49.830
Well then, all the more reason to practice.
It'll be hard unless you get more experience.

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:56.570
There are places that are even tougher in a brevet.

00:03:56.570 --> 00:04:02.300
In order to schedule rest stops, you'll need even more speed.

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:07.540
Local brevets run 200 to 1200 kilometers long.

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:09.560
12...

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:12.120
1200 kilometers...?!

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:17.570
Is it even possible for a human to ride that far?

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:20.310
Of course!

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:24.070
Oh, but we spread it out over
about four days in those cases.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:28.820
So reserving time for sleep becomes crucial.

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:33.460
Which means, you have to go faster to buy more time.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:39.020
Sure, you'll get stronger just by riding regularly,

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:45.470
but to learn how to ride fast,
you need structured, high-strain exercises.

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:50.110
So... that's why I think you should participate in the practice ride.

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:55.350
But... it's really hard, isn't it?

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:58.770
Come on! You might think it's hard,
but it's not that bad.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:02.440
Maybe you'll taste blood in your mouth, that's all.

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:04.850
Yeah, just a little.

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:09.160
So, we'll do the practice ride this weekend. Okay?

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:11.440
I-I...

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:15.420
Sure, this is something I probably need...

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:17.630
But... But...

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:21.500
We don't need to rush into it. We have time.

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:26.130
I think building up strength slowly is fine.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:30.640
All this pressure will kill your motivation.

00:05:31.780 --> 00:05:32.640
Right?

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:34.640
Yayoi-san!

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.540
You're so kind!

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:44.670
So... how about star-gazing with a night ride?

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:46.870
Night ride?

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:49.630
Aoi-chan?

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:52.540
A night ride sounds great! Let's do it!

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:55.990
Oh... you're awfully eager, Aoi.

00:05:55.990 --> 00:05:59.540
Aoi-chan, is a night ride that much fun?

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:05.700
Yeah, there aren't many cars at night,
so it's easier to ride.

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:11.510
But the silence and the dark night contrasting with
the light's illumination creates fantastical scenery...

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:16.680
It's like riding through a different world. I love it.

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:19.690
And...

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:23.220
For brevets and fléche that span over 300 kilos,

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:26.320
a night ride is unavoidable.

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.290
Is that right?

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:30.570
If your goal is to ride a fléche,

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:34.520
getting used to night rides is a good idea.

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:40.630
Sounds like fun.

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:43.090
And if it'll help me in a fléche...

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:45.590
Um...

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:48.720
I'd like to try a night ride!

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:53.100
The practice ride is important, but...

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:55.970
I'd like to experience a night ride this time.

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:59.850
So that I can do a fléche with all of you one day!

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:04.790
I guess we were rushing into a practice ride too soon.

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:06.860
I think a night ride sounds good.

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:11.630
Okay, this weekend, let's go on a night ride.

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:14.260
Yes! I can't wait!

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:19.370
Excuse me, I have to go to my part-time job.

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:20.680
See you.

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:21.500
Until next time.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:25.580
But seriously, Ami sure has changed.

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:29.140
She's starting to consider her goals.

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:32.130
That's true, but so have you, Hinako-chan.

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:33.490
Yeah..

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:37.590
I never gave much thought to who exactly I wanted to participate in a fléche with...

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:40.390
But now, I really want to ride with this team.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:42.140
You're being honest for once.

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:46.010
Well, you've changed too, haven't you?

00:07:46.010 --> 00:07:51.150
Yeah, I only recently realized how much fun riding with a team is.

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:54.500
Me too. Since riding with Ami and all of you...

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:57.660
riding my bicycle has been much more fun.

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:03.920
Yes, I'm so glad we met you and Ami-chan.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:08.660
I'm sure Ami would be really happy
to hear that. Please tell her.

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:13.180
So anyway... A night ride means...

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:26.060
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:27.340
Good evening!

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:28.870
Good evening!

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:31.680
Hey! Huh? Where's Aoi?

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:35.750
Aoi-chan said she's taking a little longer to get ready.

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:38.950
Huh? You all have different equipment than usual...

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:41.330
And lights on your helmets as well?

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:46.210
Yeah, night rides require different preparation.

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:48.830
I-Is that so?

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:52.720
What should I do? I haven't prepared at all.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.810
Ami-chan, here.

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:58.350
I brought an extra one. You can use it.

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:00.160
Oh, thanks!

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.970
Um, what's this?

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:03.910
It's a reflector vest.

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:07.420
There are reflective arm and leg bands too.

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:08.980
Like this.

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:10.710
See?

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.510
Ta-dah! How do I look?

00:09:14.510 --> 00:09:15.600
It's good.

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:17.240
It really suits you.

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:21.990
Wearing these things gets me all excited.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:25.610
I totally get you.
Feels like you're dressed for the part.

00:09:25.610 --> 00:09:29.000
So, what kind of course
are we riding tonight, Yayoi-san?

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:32.300
How about riding along the ocean?

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:36.260
The ocean? So we're taking a leisurely ride along the Enoshima coastline?

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:41.390
Yes, and we'll end up in Ito.

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:45.030
Ito? You mean Ito?

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:48.960
Isn't that... really far?

00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:53.530
Maybe about 100 kilos. It's not that far, is it?

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:59.160
Wait, wait wait. It's already really late.
The trains will stop running and...

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:03.790
Don't worry. By the time we get there, the first trains will be running.

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:08.040
What? Does that mean we'll be riding overnight?!

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.440
Of course.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:13.510
An all-night ride is a basic part of a fléche.

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:16.550
If you're serious about doing one,
get used to a night ride.

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:19.430
But...

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:22.590
But speak up if you get sleepy.

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:25.430
It would be terrible if you
forced yourself and had an accident.

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:30.910
Yayoi really is a cruel one.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:35.440
What a brutal trial for our cute, little disciple.

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:41.200
Yayoi-san, even though I thought of you as kind...

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:42.860
God is dead.

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:45.950
There's no need to be so worried about it.

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:51.520
It's 100 kilos, but the course is mostly flat,

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:54.760
so it's a route you can comfortably ride, Ami-chan.

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:56.090
Is it really?

00:10:56.090 --> 00:11:00.970
Yes, and besides, we'll see the beautiful scenery tonight.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:03.840
Well yeah, I expected that.

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:07.270
Then we can relax in a nice spa bath after the ride.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:10.710
And the seafood bowl for breakfast is exquisite.

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:14.360
Sounds great, right?

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:16.600
Yes, I can't wait!

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:17.930
I'm so glad.

00:11:17.930 --> 00:11:21.290
She's good. She was able to break through Ami's doubts in an instant...

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:22.490
She knows what she's doing.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:24.490
Sorry I'm late!

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:30.840
Thanks for waiting.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:36.980
S-Something crazy just showed up!

00:11:36.980 --> 00:11:40.720
With all this, even pitch-black hills will be safe.

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:42.470
Aoi-chan, that's amazing.

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:46.970
Well, it's bright enough, but isn't it heavy?

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:49.180
Huh? It's not a race.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:52.600
It's just a casual ride. Why would weight matter?

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:55.040
Wh-Why would it matter?

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:57.110
Has she been hiding some first-rate legs?

00:11:57.110 --> 00:12:00.300
Oh, it doesn't matter how heavy it is.

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:02.110
Of course it does, don't be fooled!

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:04.330
Oh, that's right, Ami-chan.

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:05.420
Yes?

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:07.790
Let me see your helmet for a moment.

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:09.750
Oh, sure.

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:13.790
There you go.

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:18.750
Wow, it's so bright.

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:22.730
It'll make cycling much easier.

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:24.510
Thank you!

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:27.260
Okay, shall we get going?

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:35.400
I-I can't see in front of me.

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:37.150
Oh sorry.

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:39.650
It's so bright, you're becoming a public nuisance.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:41.280
N-Nuisance?

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.760
Aoi, you take the lead.

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:47.340
That much light shining behind us is dangerous.

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:50.040
Yayoi will stay behind Ami.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:54.110
A nuisance... nuisance...

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:56.290
I'm... a nuisance.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:59.070
Okay, let's go!

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:00.220
Okay!

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:07.580
Nuisance...

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:09.970
I'm a nuisance.

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:11.850
A nuisance.

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:23.650
One a.m.

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:28.910
I rarely stay out this late.

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:31.910
Moreover, I'm cycling...

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:34.840
with my friends!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:38.420
It's such a strange feeling.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:42.720
I can't see as well as daytime, but...

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:46.680
there's plenty of light, and there are so few cars.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:49.550
It's easier to ride than expected.

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:53.120
Amazing!

00:13:56.310 --> 00:14:00.110
I didn't know the moonlight was so bright!

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:02.940
Cycling through this scenery...

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:06.950
Night riding is fun!

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:10.790
It's so different from riding during the day.

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:14.180
It feels so good.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.090
Huh?

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:34.100
No way...

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:38.100
I knew it! It's a hill!

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:41.230
Even though you said it was flat!

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:47.490
Taken as a whole, this is a flat course.

00:14:48.230 --> 00:14:51.990
Besides, Ami-chan, you've improved your climbing.

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:55.330
We're almost over this hill.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:57.250
Okay...

00:15:10.030 --> 00:15:13.140
Huh? There aren't any streetlights?

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:19.230
I can't see ahead of me.

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:22.770
This is pretty scary.

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:46.070
Th-That was...

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:48.920
I thought I was going to fall.

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:53.430
I have to catch up.

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:55.990
But...

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:57.840
I can't see...

00:15:58.390 --> 00:16:00.390
ahead of me at all...

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:03.820
What if I...?

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.420
Ami-chan?

00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:09.080
Yayoi-san...

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:11.670
Are you okay? I heard a loud noise.

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:17.410
It's so dark, I'm too scared to keep going!

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:20.550
Oh my, is it that scary?

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:22.410
Yes...

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:26.360
I mean, I can't see anything in front of me.

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:29.480
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:32.730
It seems like the headlight battery died.

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:41.990
How's that? It should be easier to see now.

00:16:43.610 --> 00:16:47.440
Wow! I think this'll work.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:48.840
Right?

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:54.820
Headlights that can illuminate your full
field of vision are crucial at places like this.

00:16:55.300 --> 00:16:58.330
I'm sorry, I put you through a scary experience.

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:00.330
Oh no...

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:04.330
One piece of equipment
can make this much of a difference...

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:08.590
If I rode without the things I borrowed...

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:10.930
things could have turned ugly.

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:14.120
Okay, let's go.

00:17:14.120 --> 00:17:15.870
Oh, okay.

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:23.120
There will be a few ups and downs, but there's no rush, take it slow.

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:25.010
Okay.

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:31.360
Nuisance... Nuisance...

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:32.810
There they are.

00:17:33.010 --> 00:17:36.520
A nuisance... Nuisance...

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:35.680
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:38.100
Good work!

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:40.480
A nuisance... A nuisance...

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:44.410
A nuisance... Am I a...?

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:46.750
Aoi-chan, what's the matter?

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:48.690
Oh, it's nothing.

00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:53.760
I just realized how important having a light is.

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:55.510
What happened?

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:58.270
Earlier, my battery died.

00:17:58.270 --> 00:18:01.640
What? Let's put half of my lights on your bicycle.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:05.820
It's okay! I had the battery changed.

00:18:05.820 --> 00:18:09.140
O-Oh? Then I guess it's fine.

00:18:09.140 --> 00:18:11.700
Yeah. Thank you, Aoi-chan.

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:12.930
Hey!

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.900
We're going to head out soon!

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:20.180
Please go ahead. I'll stay in front of Ami.

00:18:20.180 --> 00:18:21.870
Okay!

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:22.780
Aoi-chan...?

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:26.390
Just in case, I'll take the lead and light the way.

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:28.420
Let's ride together, Ami.

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.150
Okay!

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:58.570
Hey! Just a little more! Hang in there.

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:01.910
I finally caught up!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.650
Good job, Ami.

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:10.920
You really hung in there.

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:13.790
Ami, good work.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:19.770
The climb is over. The rest is downhill or flat.

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:22.050
Th-Thank goodness!

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:25.370
The Autumn Ride made you much stronger.

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:27.930
You think so?

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:30.940
All right, this is a good time.

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:32.810
Time?

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:36.220
Yes, perfect timing at a perfect place.

00:19:36.220 --> 00:19:37.090
Right?

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:41.200
Ami, over here.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:20:00.680
This is the true reward of an overnighter.

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:03.470
It's like we just got back from the nocturnal world.

00:20:03.910 --> 00:20:06.320
People begin their daily lives once again...

00:20:06.320 --> 00:20:10.230
and the sounds reverberate through the once silent world.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:15.440
We can revel in this sight only because we rode all night.

00:20:16.140 --> 00:20:19.440
I love this view.

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:24.450
We asked you along today...

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:28.980
to experience the moment this town comes to life.

00:20:32.950 --> 00:20:35.160
The moment when the town...

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:37.220
comes to life!

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:42.350
How do you like it?

00:20:42.350 --> 00:20:45.890
I love it!

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:47.560
I'm so glad.

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:51.990
It's my first time...

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:55.900
riding through the night, and seeing this view.

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:00.330
Since I began cycling...

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:03.270
I've had so many "firsts."

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:05.280
Ami...

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:09.620
I feel like there will be many more to come...

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:11.790
...if I continue riding my bicycle.

00:21:12.150 --> 00:21:16.710
I'm so glad I took up cycling.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:20.800
Cycling has really broadened my world!

00:21:24.870 --> 00:21:27.730
Okay, we're almost at our goal.

00:21:27.730 --> 00:21:29.440
Shall we go?

00:21:29.440 --> 00:21:32.060
The hot springs and the seafood bowl await!

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:33.330
Okay!

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:37.120
And so...

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:41.360
my first night ride was a huge success.

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:44.320
I experienced another one of cycling's beauties...

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:47.980
and grew to love it even more!

00:21:49.470 --> 00:21:50.330
But...

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:54.240
after riding all night...

00:21:55.340 --> 00:21:57.830
I'm really sleepy.

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:32.890
The sunrise after an all-night ride...

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:37.360
If I hadn't started cycling, I may never have seen it.

00:23:37.360 --> 00:23:40.760
Next time, the final episode of Long Riders!

00:23:40.760 --> 00:23:44.940
I want to keep on seeing lots of sights with everyone.
